{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "9c3e3da5dcc111822630ca6f06d42ffdf326c63ee99925b5d41630b3f946c727",
  "bundle_request_count": 20,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:09b4abaf6fb640f64431268f30c46face4843c6a5dfd72ce93fec6b761692035",
      "request_id": "09b4abaf6fb640f64431268f30c46face4843c6a5dfd72ce93fec6b761692035",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb29e7b00b574bea315b9db42b0a82b3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "喜欢网球，开始变成每天都要完成的生活。二零二五年三月，她从资格赛出发，拿下特拉萨赛事冠军，拿到生涯首座，成人职业赛事单打奖杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "62d2cea00ec0da321d05abf17cd32c6423ffaef72a994bcda7b7509915c30243",
      "words_sha256": "d0fe84b0bdaf047094caaeccef9e49bfd1aa60414e1a65efb9637ce8cd69d482"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:110131f43c24302515646dc1bcc3f035677fcb6dfdf0786f5f46e40316c3ae49",
      "request_id": "110131f43c24302515646dc1bcc3f035677fcb6dfdf0786f5f46e40316c3ae49",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "533af4a7be76750a674a628b1c11595b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她教塔格尔怎样把这一拍用进比赛，也教她怎样面对紧张、保持专注。二零二五年的报道里，塔格尔已经在意大利生活和训练，通过博尔扎诺的学校在线学习，考试时再到学校。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7b74e705117f4a608609ec91c1d31e2cb30e12a173ebf9250fa701cd09d2275d",
      "words_sha256": "f64e83ab2f8c4d9d833433d3a518ddf426ae0961dd16e0d34a0556f1d895e0c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:336300a5e0166412530584d1fe068d019ce354578d6919c988c4bd3a83c2cd31",
      "request_id": "336300a5e0166412530584d1fe068d019ce354578d6919c988c4bd3a83c2cd31",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "329f4d2c25f8fc5322a61277afb266d2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的教练，是最近一位单反大满贯女单冠军，二零一零年法网的斯齐亚沃尼。次年她在决赛输给李娜，见证亚洲首座大满贯单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d44a5b2ff76f3ef00045fcd180b8a131a685c7b7bcca7cd53e687d14159b8aaa",
      "words_sha256": "faa042ca6ea09d014af2eed3967c8b4f104b61487a997366d1569edd319c0ff3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:39ea1190e0948aca8291e2d953925180961db0c3a3a182bded2a11022c14eb4a",
      "request_id": "39ea1190e0948aca8291e2d953925180961db0c3a3a182bded2a11022c14eb4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "36ffea7a50f2653f9b4972db1a51b356",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月来到巴黎。法网青年组女单，六场比赛，一盘未失。决赛六比二、六比零，她击败克卢格曼，成为奥地利第一位，法网青年组单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1635dfdd71d91888716a025b797ed788ee1872ef50c9f848e29fe5e447bd5e0b",
      "words_sha256": "c29e597e623f1206f563b7401ef9bd84fba9c6e9a4b468f923827d22d2d3258f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3cee1244e9392437861e038becf14589cfd1586e5059648502cdea1db2145f7c",
      "request_id": "3cee1244e9392437861e038becf14589cfd1586e5059648502cdea1db2145f7c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4c970d29c51f73307a50784b29ed6a33",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "女子网坛，单手打反拍的球员已经很少了。可这个姑娘，小时候就主动想练。她叫莉莉·塔格尔，如今已经站上广州决赛的舞台。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bd113dd040aab912c46b72f37344c40f3f11abbeebff00a7f84210e5a0ef8ab9",
      "words_sha256": "6206f7dec2c0a4e1c0b5cc780bf7abefd9a2a273b59e8e4d93c47fe5cf01ba5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:472432d5404f2706ea21c115cccf49f771bece93fd26242989681848c90f20b1",
      "request_id": "472432d5404f2706ea21c115cccf49f771bece93fd26242989681848c90f20b1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "efb6154ae56652caf6da45e203cb3e80",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年四月，她在本国的林茨打进八强，首次进入世界前一百。七月，布拉格又给了她一次考验。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2afafc2c4bf40951a7b89f3aae816fcd719ef1dd324f1da6847dff1948084414",
      "words_sha256": "a7f467cc086137a0c7be323197471353bbfca32e3fc24d71061433fa34d35987"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5570033222a155b2edf13c8253b36383d20bb5d6590914592720b50ccb251165",
      "request_id": "5570033222a155b2edf13c8253b36383d20bb5d6590914592720b50ccb251165",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b74333c9e6be8be1e4b03c6aa8f1829b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "小时候，她和教练约定：如果赢下这次比赛，就让她改练单手反拍。后来，她赢了。那个小女孩想试的一拍，也留在了她的职业生涯里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "564f865de47aa5c6d56e2e511f73c886f623357dbdb5e8a4d3c61f5f603a74b1",
      "words_sha256": "7589638e073b39b6864c9343aa3c9aece72f8640ee0431041aaee429078798e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5c475770ff50ec46b6d6ca0b393bc72408fec436c266417033690ec0e37a9bf3",
      "request_id": "5c475770ff50ec46b6d6ca0b393bc72408fec436c266417033690ec0e37a9bf3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d9e597ec8a4235a0a36f8683144bd240",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年十月，十五岁的塔格尔，开始跟随斯齐亚沃尼训练。两个人都打单手反拍。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e2a8d6b6cb1f311d50d9a3eb8816a364cad4d3c27fc89c6796f9e05f60708c21",
      "words_sha256": "3dbb2f33371f4a5bb2979cb4853b393a8881c270129e564daa56ad399b67b479"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:642c388707b9f007d2d716c8d6cf4916d3c0bfc7d62b849d53b70b1c2ba131a5",
      "request_id": "642c388707b9f007d2d716c8d6cf4916d3c0bfc7d62b849d53b70b1c2ba131a5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a9958c266954c26386cbfc9489580016",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在，塔格尔已经晋级广州决赛，将争取生涯第二座巡回赛单打冠军。小时候，她只说我想这样打。走到更大的赛场，中间有教练，有训练，也有必须自己打完的难球。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cd65d856eaa73eff8636f75b1a169850626d93c8e63f02284f52507dae16a306",
      "words_sha256": "3de4c1ebacc47796c3f626a05b623faa8765a6f3006e8f5fcbecccf6fcc61510"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6e5cca2e99347b83959207be3c7c8b5d4278e5c91fb2ed6f2cc8d547e9a1b3da",
      "request_id": "6e5cca2e99347b83959207be3c7c8b5d4278e5c91fb2ed6f2cc8d547e9a1b3da",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "212175b053f9901dc94877afb937d4ba",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "单反给了人们记住她的理由，学习与成长，让她一次次走得更远。你小时候很喜欢、后来也一直坚持的那件事，现在怎么样了？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e10abf2b39f1206c3a677c3ecc50a97d845312285530ff298d9d0fd17192ef2c",
      "words_sha256": "7633c931627e9c339015e620f6013ddc6a31e325187c05d71f344a0ba63493f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c0bcf2f98bf65f8e53762bda04e6ef0a0a173c61f6338bb20c2ff69b1abecf68",
      "request_id": "c0bcf2f98bf65f8e53762bda04e6ef0a0a173c61f6338bb20c2ff69b1abecf68",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9449c7d3d8efbd9654f3d38e96b296e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "塔格尔偏要单手打，一路打进广州决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6b9372df2bc61681f5e35c0867d653be445b68f3d934e91abe12295768fae20b",
      "words_sha256": "b1181a198f4938d91f3386f5a76b1b685327b4d3f63c4b2fea1c842c7d2b1009"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d21a1a03400b498b2d6e52b5848e002f45baf2259142e541b062a05741bcbc62",
      "request_id": "d21a1a03400b498b2d6e52b5848e002f45baf2259142e541b062a05741bcbc62",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9188900751f061fdf827c69edd1dc8b4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十五年前，教练在这里捧杯；十五年后，学生赢下了青年组冠军。那是一次动人的呼应。接下来，她还要面对成人巡回赛的考验。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "00fb859321612252122b195b75ee1b521c987e0c86a31603503cd869aad6b1d0",
      "words_sha256": "46b7bd1c386ed87fd5d6df30addf0c73853fa711e63e6890cb58ecbd5eb7b07f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dab283d96c0c5f11c3894d69b0ba0d46d6b9110f35c89e3f926eabe48b0743e5",
      "request_id": "dab283d96c0c5f11c3894d69b0ba0d46d6b9110f35c89e3f926eabe48b0743e5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7f83dcd1cf6ea2e48f5914a72797da00",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "塔格尔来自奥地利利恩茨。五岁开始规律练球，最初一周只有一小时。从儿童小球场起步，她已经很喜欢往网前跑，主动把一分打完。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "327326913b8cfd613dae634fffa9131f06a7fce8d928cd7562faa3d864321dc7",
      "words_sha256": "99da7099babd18ac9ffb4c0270ff25d9e66f4bd3c921ed0339fe2193b8c97269"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dcfee85dd67e7e26a2ecace381bb7f1b1fe181d8472c5b38b2960de6159090b5",
      "request_id": "dcfee85dd67e7e26a2ecace381bb7f1b1fe181d8472c5b38b2960de6159090b5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7ce4aa3f6556533d12e975e2bf1b6937",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在法网采访里回忆，当时并不知道换打法可能有多难，只觉得打起来很有乐趣。这个选择，发生在斯齐亚沃尼成为她的教练之前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1940d6b53329c763340c812003d06a3dcbd96d25029ba141b4b0fab7e0e00bac",
      "words_sha256": "c8f185260f542d5f235c1ac4cff7d50a3f78258263cc1563f78109b909379efe"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e3483cda782d8a77eb708df1400908dc24e9c7c39145ecbfbde6c541f2a0bbdb",
      "request_id": "e3483cda782d8a77eb708df1400908dc24e9c7c39145ecbfbde6c541f2a0bbdb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c0d31b5fa16121bcf6e154e858372fc4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二五年十一月，九江。塔格尔第一次打，巡回赛单打正赛。半决赛对面，是卫冕冠军戈卢比奇。巧的是，她也打单反。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "14e1977befd6c610f830f2da07c402cfe7930c1991c43e2be92d754436f26f47",
      "words_sha256": "07c8ccc23cce5a1a7d27816cb78c1dfd01783651c466efde0f9769949b603f3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:eb35d9aa5703587173eab51fcd5855ee4ac43b6a696d77e1956d5c4f4ade31a2",
      "request_id": "eb35d9aa5703587173eab51fcd5855ee4ac43b6a696d77e1956d5c4f4ade31a2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c7036087205e4f87409d3163376138ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛首盘，她二比五落后于斯尼古尔。她追到五比五，随后赢下抢七，再以六比二拿下第二盘，第一次成为巡回赛单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "873c36cee3a47aeb442034ac71be552d5766af3e6033a3a06d207c2ce9d81856",
      "words_sha256": "2824c626674387bbafa367d840c3114f1de5331e18ecff2bc72d6dd9f0604fbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f3e6a1c1c0d8dde8eb673e40a9d9184a4be6224dbe7ac004ae604c22e334c72a",
      "request_id": "f3e6a1c1c0d8dde8eb673e40a9d9184a4be6224dbe7ac004ae604c22e334c72a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c3b206645561668d8448d311bf87772c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "回看那次夺冠，她还提到了前一周的失利。到了布拉格，再遇见之前击败自己的对手，她把从败仗里学到的东西用进了比赛。进步未必立刻换来奖杯。输过的一场，也能为下一场做准备。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b73d0dda114ec6cb34eedc1fd2954f4a2f963bf12edb38f7717c08e7a474d58d",
      "words_sha256": "d59736e76bac0639f92317a6687d7866cd1d5fba22cc990e0659fe8b167eb5ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f5bd42ce4dc076980b2a6edb6dd10a136cb49866a41dac267d1034c41bd30719",
      "request_id": "f5bd42ce4dc076980b2a6edb6dd10a136cb49866a41dac267d1034c41bd30719",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3dfa98824f38548b68f13f4206ece238",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她把三个赛点全部救了回来，最终七比五赢下决胜盘。舒展的反拍之外，人们也看到，她落后时仍在争取。第一次参加巡回赛正赛，她就打进决赛，那一周最终收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0910c24d3aa5a519b00e95dbdbaf1c8ef73a0f24c229da8ee227c1137e38cadb",
      "words_sha256": "168df0548e5876afdc59f0041df68388f5721d15332348c2541a3dc3787a5910"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f6ef5a0389505c7fe4327023be395b410ed5ef5431bbe6db3c61aac9a735919f",
      "request_id": "f6ef5a0389505c7fe4327023be395b410ed5ef5431bbe6db3c61aac9a735919f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "afc75cfaa3fd654ba4e7431b6887511f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，塔格尔二比五落后。追回两局后，她仍在四比五时面对三个连续赛点。对手再赢一分，比赛就结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8ca09e9a10442ba5642b10c52343b6cb1e0c39ceca1365eea57f9ee9251d58b2",
      "words_sha256": "4b7b1764a87209fb6f7875f386a6aa6cedb43a1f29734f5a1ceab18b35b27a8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bd113dd040aab912c46b72f37344c40f3f11abbeebff00a7f84210e5a0ef8ab9",
      "words_sha256": "6206f7dec2c0a4e1c0b5cc780bf7abefd9a2a273b59e8e4d93c47fe5cf01ba5d",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4c970d29c51f73307a50784b29ed6a33",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "女子网坛，单手打反拍的球员已经很少了。可这个姑娘，小时候就主动想练。她叫莉莉·塔格尔，如今已经站上广州决赛的舞台。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "564f865de47aa5c6d56e2e511f73c886f623357dbdb5e8a4d3c61f5f603a74b1",
      "words_sha256": "7589638e073b39b6864c9343aa3c9aece72f8640ee0431041aaee429078798e6",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b74333c9e6be8be1e4b03c6aa8f1829b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "小时候，她和教练约定：如果赢下这次比赛，就让她改练单手反拍。后来，她赢了。那个小女孩想试的一拍，也留在了她的职业生涯里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "327326913b8cfd613dae634fffa9131f06a7fce8d928cd7562faa3d864321dc7",
      "words_sha256": "99da7099babd18ac9ffb4c0270ff25d9e66f4bd3c921ed0339fe2193b8c97269",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7f83dcd1cf6ea2e48f5914a72797da00",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "塔格尔来自奥地利利恩茨。五岁开始规律练球，最初一周只有一小时。从儿童小球场起步，她已经很喜欢往网前跑，主动把一分打完。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1940d6b53329c763340c812003d06a3dcbd96d25029ba141b4b0fab7e0e00bac",
      "words_sha256": "c8f185260f542d5f235c1ac4cff7d50a3f78258263cc1563f78109b909379efe",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7ce4aa3f6556533d12e975e2bf1b6937",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在法网采访里回忆，当时并不知道换打法可能有多难，只觉得打起来很有乐趣。这个选择，发生在斯齐亚沃尼成为她的教练之前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e2a8d6b6cb1f311d50d9a3eb8816a364cad4d3c27fc89c6796f9e05f60708c21",
      "words_sha256": "3dbb2f33371f4a5bb2979cb4853b393a8881c270129e564daa56ad399b67b479",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d9e597ec8a4235a0a36f8683144bd240",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二三年十月，十五岁的塔格尔，开始跟随斯齐亚沃尼训练。两个人都打单手反拍。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d44a5b2ff76f3ef00045fcd180b8a131a685c7b7bcca7cd53e687d14159b8aaa",
      "words_sha256": "faa042ca6ea09d014af2eed3967c8b4f104b61487a997366d1569edd319c0ff3",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "329f4d2c25f8fc5322a61277afb266d2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她的教练，是最近一位单反大满贯女单冠军，二零一零年法网的斯齐亚沃尼。次年她在决赛输给李娜，见证亚洲首座大满贯单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7b74e705117f4a608609ec91c1d31e2cb30e12a173ebf9250fa701cd09d2275d",
      "words_sha256": "f64e83ab2f8c4d9d833433d3a518ddf426ae0961dd16e0d34a0556f1d895e0c8",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "533af4a7be76750a674a628b1c11595b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她教塔格尔怎样把这一拍用进比赛，也教她怎样面对紧张、保持专注。二零二五年的报道里，塔格尔已经在意大利生活和训练，通过博尔扎诺的学校在线学习，考试时再到学校。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "62d2cea00ec0da321d05abf17cd32c6423ffaef72a994bcda7b7509915c30243",
      "words_sha256": "d0fe84b0bdaf047094caaeccef9e49bfd1aa60414e1a65efb9637ce8cd69d482",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb29e7b00b574bea315b9db42b0a82b3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "喜欢网球，开始变成每天都要完成的生活。二零二五年三月，她从资格赛出发，拿下特拉萨赛事冠军，拿到生涯首座，成人职业赛事单打奖杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1635dfdd71d91888716a025b797ed788ee1872ef50c9f848e29fe5e447bd5e0b",
      "words_sha256": "c29e597e623f1206f563b7401ef9bd84fba9c6e9a4b468f923827d22d2d3258f",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "36ffea7a50f2653f9b4972db1a51b356",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六月来到巴黎。法网青年组女单，六场比赛，一盘未失。决赛六比二、六比零，她击败克卢格曼，成为奥地利第一位，法网青年组单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "00fb859321612252122b195b75ee1b521c987e0c86a31603503cd869aad6b1d0",
      "words_sha256": "46b7bd1c386ed87fd5d6df30addf0c73853fa711e63e6890cb58ecbd5eb7b07f",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9188900751f061fdf827c69edd1dc8b4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十五年前，教练在这里捧杯；十五年后，学生赢下了青年组冠军。那是一次动人的呼应。接下来，她还要面对成人巡回赛的考验。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "14e1977befd6c610f830f2da07c402cfe7930c1991c43e2be92d754436f26f47",
      "words_sha256": "07c8ccc23cce5a1a7d27816cb78c1dfd01783651c466efde0f9769949b603f3a",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c0d31b5fa16121bcf6e154e858372fc4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二五年十一月，九江。塔格尔第一次打，巡回赛单打正赛。半决赛对面，是卫冕冠军戈卢比奇。巧的是，她也打单反。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8ca09e9a10442ba5642b10c52343b6cb1e0c39ceca1365eea57f9ee9251d58b2",
      "words_sha256": "4b7b1764a87209fb6f7875f386a6aa6cedb43a1f29734f5a1ceab18b35b27a8b",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "afc75cfaa3fd654ba4e7431b6887511f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，塔格尔二比五落后。追回两局后，她仍在四比五时面对三个连续赛点。对手再赢一分，比赛就结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0910c24d3aa5a519b00e95dbdbaf1c8ef73a0f24c229da8ee227c1137e38cadb",
      "words_sha256": "168df0548e5876afdc59f0041df68388f5721d15332348c2541a3dc3787a5910",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3dfa98824f38548b68f13f4206ece238",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她把三个赛点全部救了回来，最终七比五赢下决胜盘。舒展的反拍之外，人们也看到，她落后时仍在争取。第一次参加巡回赛正赛，她就打进决赛，那一周最终收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2afafc2c4bf40951a7b89f3aae816fcd719ef1dd324f1da6847dff1948084414",
      "words_sha256": "a7f467cc086137a0c7be323197471353bbfca32e3fc24d71061433fa34d35987",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "efb6154ae56652caf6da45e203cb3e80",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年四月，她在本国的林茨打进八强，首次进入世界前一百。七月，布拉格又给了她一次考验。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "873c36cee3a47aeb442034ac71be552d5766af3e6033a3a06d207c2ce9d81856",
      "words_sha256": "2824c626674387bbafa367d840c3114f1de5331e18ecff2bc72d6dd9f0604fbf",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c7036087205e4f87409d3163376138ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛首盘，她二比五落后于斯尼古尔。她追到五比五，随后赢下抢七，再以六比二拿下第二盘，第一次成为巡回赛单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b73d0dda114ec6cb34eedc1fd2954f4a2f963bf12edb38f7717c08e7a474d58d",
      "words_sha256": "d59736e76bac0639f92317a6687d7866cd1d5fba22cc990e0659fe8b167eb5ef",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c3b206645561668d8448d311bf87772c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "回看那次夺冠，她还提到了前一周的失利。到了布拉格，再遇见之前击败自己的对手，她把从败仗里学到的东西用进了比赛。进步未必立刻换来奖杯。输过的一场，也能为下一场做准备。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cd65d856eaa73eff8636f75b1a169850626d93c8e63f02284f52507dae16a306",
      "words_sha256": "3de4c1ebacc47796c3f626a05b623faa8765a6f3006e8f5fcbecccf6fcc61510",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a9958c266954c26386cbfc9489580016",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在，塔格尔已经晋级广州决赛，将争取生涯第二座巡回赛单打冠军。小时候，她只说我想这样打。走到更大的赛场，中间有教练，有训练，也有必须自己打完的难球。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e10abf2b39f1206c3a677c3ecc50a97d845312285530ff298d9d0fd17192ef2c",
      "words_sha256": "7633c931627e9c339015e620f6013ddc6a31e325187c05d71f344a0ba63493f3",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "212175b053f9901dc94877afb937d4ba",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "单反给了人们记住她的理由，学习与成长，让她一次次走得更远。你小时候很喜欢、后来也一直坚持的那件事，现在怎么样了？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6b9372df2bc61681f5e35c0867d653be445b68f3d934e91abe12295768fae20b",
      "words_sha256": "b1181a198f4938d91f3386f5a76b1b685327b4d3f63c4b2fea1c842c7d2b1009",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9449c7d3d8efbd9654f3d38e96b296e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "塔格尔偏要单手打，一路打进广州决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d01422f286e7af5fcb3cad995867c7b55dc5ee16f6c86f3e3b83990789fd5f97",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
